  "body": "### Description\r\nLoading messages history in `#konversation:matrix.org` is not working at the moment. As @ara4n suggested it may be a case of a specific broken room due to migration between the two Freenode bridges.\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n- Login to a matrix.org user (didn't try other homeservers).\r\n- `/join #konversation:matrix.org` and open the room in any client\r\n\r\nExpected: the timeline backlog is filled in with messages.\r\nActual: the timeline backlog is empty, the client-side logs (Quaternion and Riot Web in my case) reveal that the server consistently responds with 500.\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n- **Homeserver**: matrix.org\r\n- **Platform**: most likely cross-platform but I only tried Windows client-side.",
